{"id":"446848","name":"灵芝竹荪公鸡汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/446848/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芦花大公鸡","amount":"1只"},{"name":"灵芝","amount":"1朵"},{"name":"竹荪","amount":"5棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"在活禽店买的芦花大公鸡，商家给宰杀好，拿回来洗净。洗一朵灵芝。","img":"images/446848/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放紫砂煲中。","img":"images/446848/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放纯净水。","img":"images/446848/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水差不多和食材持平。","img":"images/446848/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"选自动控制。","img":"images/446848/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炖3小时的样子。","img":"images/446848/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取竹荪。","img":"images/446848/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"买来忘了，过了一年了，看见美友的竹荪汤突然想起来了。","img":"images/446848/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取几朵洗净。","img":"images/446848/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放鸡汤内。","img":"images/446848/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再炖1小时即可。","img":"images/446848/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/446848/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电子瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}